the world of Pokemon is a bright  colorful place full of unusual animals  and if you're anything like the average  gamer you've spent hundreds of hours  wandering through the wilderness looking  for Pocket Monsters to fight kidnap and  train to battle for you it's a vicious  cycle and that underlying weirdness has  given rise to some of the strangest  creepiest video game bootlegs and mods  of any series out there after seeing  these Pokemon bootlegs we're not sure if  you'll want to catch em all Pokemon  creepy black the bizarre rumor of  pokemons creepy black first popped up  around 2005 when someone supposedly  found an all-black Gameboy cart at a  flea market the game gives you the  option to start out with your standard  Pokemon but you can also start out with  ghosts a Pokemon that can do only one  thing  instantly terrify other pokemons and  trainers to death by the end of the game  your trusty ghost turns on you and you  two are dragged into the cold cold  ground as with most online horror  stories Pokemon creepy black probably  wasn't a legit kart but the weird  Internet story inspired multiple modders  to bring the game to life in ROM form  download it if you'd like a sleepless  night or two pondering the ethics of  being a pokemon trainer just watch out  for those ghost types the creepy doesn't  stop there however Hypno's lullaby a mod  that arose from a creepypasta poem  Hypno's lullaby is all about the strange  hypnotic pokemon and his secret penchant  for kidnapping small children and  bringing them to his cave and berry  forest one could argue that every single  Pokemon deserves a bit of revenge for  how they're treated by their trainers  and Hypno's lullaby exacts that revenge  tenfold your hero really has no option  but to grab a starter Pokemon and wander  into the woods where you're immediately  captured by hypno and trapped in a cave  with other zonked out kids as you work  your way out of the cave you can only  order your Pokemon to kill Hypno's  juvenile slaves who block every exit  then you work your way through a tower  full of unbeatable ghosts and the  spirits of children you've killed  eventually hypno throws one last barrage  of children at you before trapping you  in a room where he eats your dreams for  all eternity  there is no end you  shut off the game and quietly walk away  telling no one what you've done there is  even more for you however if you like  your pokemons full of death and despair  Pokemon snakewood pokemon ruby is a  popular Pokemon game to mod and Pokemon  snakewood is just one strange example of  the results snake wood crosses Pokemon  with the walking dead  the results is a game in a  post-apocalyptic setting populated by  zombies and demons where even the  pokemon have adorably creepy names like  polly wraith and head doom in true  Walking Dead style your hero wakes up in  a destroyed town encounter someone being  attacked by zombies and finds a safe  zone as you play you eventually battle  the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse  which is a lot scarier than just  battling some spoiled kid who likes  forcing animals to fight one another  it's a surprisingly robust story for an  unofficial game snakewood proves that  Pokemon has its fair share of inventive  and weird fans Pokemon courts do you  love the concept of Pokemon but hate all  of those corporate Nintendo approved  monsters well Pokemon courts may be the  game for you dedicated Pokemon  bootleggers made a copy of Ruby and  replaced all of the official Pokemon  sprites with their own malformed  creations while these Pocket Monsters  names and appearances have changed their  powers and stats remain intact why have  the charm Anders been replaced with  these our best scientists are still  working on an answer quartz is  criticized for being relatively  amateurish and incomplete but the visual  overhaul of so many lovable and popular  Pokemon is just so weirdly obsessive and  pointless that it can't be ignored  Pokemon suite modded from firered  Pokemon suite reimagines the entire  world of Pokemon as a surreal Candy  Kingdom like place here everything is  made of desserts and delicious danger  lurks around every corner because just  walking around cotton candy fields isn't  enough your favorite Pokemon now called  pokey sweets are now named after snacks  Bulbasaur becomes brownie sore and gets  a dollop of whipped cream and a cherry  and pops a chew has a giant wooden stick  shoved into its head Pokemon types are  now flavours instead and you basically  just ruined your dinner the deadliest  attack in the game diabetes  vuillemin emerald fire red for those who  want their pokemon experience to be even  weirder mo Amon is for you  Molly maan replaces all of those totally  unattractive monsters with sprites of  cosplay girls dressed up as Pokemon  instead raising even more ethical  questions than the original because  pitting animals in death matches against  one another isn't horrifying enough you  now send costume girls into the arena to  fight one another until one finally  passes out from the pain instead of  building your pokemons collection you  slowly grow a violent confusing little  harem pokémon ash gray true pokey nerds  know the differences between the  original Pokemon games and the anime of  the same name ash gray inventively  tweaks the original game script and  missions to actually follow the events  of the offshoot media including many  episode specific events from giving  Donuts to primates to leaving Pikachu to  live with other Pikachu in the forest  the results is a carton of Easter eggs  for devotees of the Pokemon universe who  may have found the original games  lacking after seeing the more colorful  anime if the cartoon isn't your thing  however there are even more options for  players who want something more out of  Pokemon than just grinding for gangers  Pokemon advanced adventure as far as  narrative structure goes the Pokemon  anime series is still pretty flimsy ash  doesn't have any real motivation to be  the best pokemon trainer in the world  aside from the fact that it's something  to do in a world without standardized  education or non Pokemon based  employment opportunities Pokemon  advanced adventure flips the script and  rewrites Ash as a kid struggling against  poverty genetically modified Pokemon and  Professor Oak's insane tyrannical  grandson whose only purpose is to Train  pokemons to kill finally ash is written  as an actual hero and not just some  animal hoarder with dozens of neglected  pets pokemon vietnamese crystal while  most of these games are intentionally  strange there are also a few examples  that are amazing by accident like  pokemon vietnamese crystal fake pokemon  cards are a huge business and kotake  reports that this was a genuine bootleg  that circulated in vietnam before it was  poorly translated  to English as a result the games text is  hilarious it regularly drops profanity  calls pokemon elves and barely attempts  to make sense since it's just a  mistranslated Pokemon game without any  big changes it plays just fine if you  can make the right text selections  through the garbled menus and figure out  what the game means by phrases like  volcano baked meat which kind of sounds  exactly like something Guy Fieri would  serve 2003 pocket monster carbuncle  unlike most pokemons bootlegs which just  tweak existing code 2003 pocket monster  carbuckle actually attempts some  originality according to a geek party  review the resulting game plays a bit  like the classic NES Dragon Warrior but  also reduces the number of Pokemon to 20  tossing biodiversity out the window the  word carbuncle usually refers to a  cluster of boils which would be  appropriate enough for this game but  it's also an obscure word for a red  gemstone which fits in with pokemons  recurring theme of naming games after  fancy rocks  unfortunately 2003 pocket monster  carbuncle is a garbage game and it  doesn't play like Pokemon in any sense  whatsoever but points for trying  something new unknown foreign plagiarize  errs Pocket Monsters Go Go Go now we  enter the realm of the truly terrible  for no reason whatsoever other than to  dupe unsuspecting Pokemon fans some  horrible soul switched out sprites from  the Smurfs nightmare for Game Boy Color  made it run at half speed and pretended  it was a Pokemon game even the most  lonely fanfic writers never asked for a  Smurfs Pokemon crossover but anything is  possible when you have no friends  starting off your adventure you're  greeted by a talking Meowth head who  rambles the following every night in my  dreams I see you I feel you you are here  so I very fear there is some hate that  will not go away then you send your  morbidly obese Pikachu through some kind  of Satan town with flickering  seizure-inducing backgrounds you then  quickly pull the card out of your  Gameboy and throw it across the room  before it's too late  Pokemon Stadium super nintendo addition  despite pokemons relentless popularity  there was never an official game made  for the original Nintendo Entertainment  System or the Super Nintendo in fact the  first  major Pokemon game for consoles was the  Nintendo 64 is pokemon stadium so it  makes little sense to reverse-engineer  an n64 cartridge to an older gaming  system the SNES was pretty outdated by  this time so making bootlegs of  imaginary games wasn't really  economically viable it's like trying to  sell a fake dial-up modem even if it's  real  no one needs one anymore much like the  real pokemon stadium the SNES bootleg is  a turn-based fighter but with a limited  roster of 12 Pokemon they all have  incorrect names  Diglett as daggits Mewtwo is Moo and  Jigglypuff is : it's a fully functional  game unlike most bootlegs but it's a  step in the wrong direction just like  the final game in our list pokemons four  and one another relic from the age of  the original Nintendo Pokemon foreign  one is one of those terrible anthology  games that crams for games onto a card  to apologize for all of them sucking and  again because the nintendo entertainment  system was becoming a thing of the past  by the time Pokemon was popular this is  just weird the game includes pika click  where you click on groups of matching  symbols pika dance where you tap on  pokeballs in time to a song peak a slot  which is a slot machine for amateur  gamblers and pac-man which is pac-man  but with a disembodied Pikachu head  every single aspect of this is a waste  of money and time but because it's  bizarre and obscure fogey collectors  will sell their pokey kidneys to get  their hands on one thanks for watching  subscribe to our YouTube channel to  watch more videos like the one you just  saw and leave us a comment to let us  know which bootleg Pokemon game you  think is the weirdest
 

